    "body": "## Compatibility\n\n**IntelEngine 3.5.1 requires SkyrimNet Beta 25 or newer. It is not compatible with SkyrimNet Beta 24 or earlier.**\n\nThis repository carries a compatibility update for current SkyrimNet releases. IntelEngine was originally created by [Galanx](https://github.com/galanx).\n\n## Changes\n\n- Moves IntelEngine's 14 action definitions and 11 prompts into the SkyrimNet Beta 25 external bundle at `galanx.intelengine`.\n- Preserves action names and Papyrus entry points while removing retired loose-path copies.\n- Updates the native dashboard to enumerate actions from the external bundle.\n- Keeps IntelEngine plugin settings and faction configuration under `config/plugins/IntelEngine`.\n- Updates package and native component versions to 3.5.1.\n\n## Installation\n\nDownload `IntelEngine-v3.5.1.zip` and install it with Mod Organizer 2.\n\nSHA-256: `e45515608520d580604526fac524a0c023db3d42cf3f39c2827702a19c9e5575`\n\nIn-game validation completed successfully with SkyrimNet Beta 25: external content registration, actions, dashboard controls, character-bio prompts, and periodic DM prompts were exercised end-to-end.\n"
